<p>Hurl ice shards at the targets in the selected area. Each shard travels slowly and does <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> ice damage, hitting all adjacent targets on impact with 25% chance to freeze them.</p><p>If the target resists being frozen, it instead get wet.</p><p>If the target is wet the damage increases by 30% and the ice freeze chance increases to 50%.</p><p>This spell will never hit the caster.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>